  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Energy density in magnetic field is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>. Therefore, dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;will be equal to the dimensions of energy per unit volume.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
